[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082115995","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108676#issuecomment-3082115995","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108676","id":3082115995,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63tVub","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T01:52:28Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T02:01:50Z","body":"There is an error `Parse Error: Function \"free()\" not found in base self.` when running in the console. This looks like a serious issue. Basically, free() doesn't exist in the release template, and any project using it will break.\n\nThis is because `free()` is registered as a virtual method.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/06bb9f28e740aa005b9d48643becfefa5156487d/core/object/object.cpp#L1648\n\nHowever, the virtual method table only exists in debug mode so `ClassDB::get_method_info()` can't find it.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7826b6b13fccf57d1461794afc560853c4d2531d/core/object/class_db.cpp#L1007-L1030\n\nWhen the parser processes a `free()` call here, it can't find a signature in the `ClassDB`  in release template and fails.\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7826b6b13fccf57d1461794afc560853c4d2531d/modules/gdscript/gdscript_analyzer.cpp#L3618\n\nMaybe it can be resolved with a special case handling like this PR I found while searching for similar issues https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/87294.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3082115995/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3083547834","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108676#issuecomment-3083547834","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108676","id":3083547834,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc63yzS6","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-07-17T10:39:15Z","updated_at":"2025-07-17T10:39:15Z","body":"So is i